BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dinosaur Fossils and Ancient Life
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T193000
UID:6aa9846d65abe8002a796feb@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for an interactive presentation about dinosaurs
 \, fossils\, and other ancient natural relics from eons past.  In this pre
 sentation\, you will:\nlearn about the evolutionary origins of various fos
 sil specimens\nlearn about phylogeny and the ‘Tree of Life’\nparticipa
 te in a guided discussion with the presenter and other patrons
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101\, first floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9846d65abe8002a796feb
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
