DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T153000
UID:6ab70c0d86d845003118d9b6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:We'll create a beautiful candle holder with mason jars\, paint
 \, and fall leaves! Bring some beautiful autumnal light to your evenings.\
 nOther activities\, such as colouring and board games\, are always availab
 le at our Friday Crafts sessions. Come have fun and meet some new people f
 rom your community!\nDrop in.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Small Meeting Room\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab70c0d86d845003118d9b6
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tech Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261005T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261005T150000
UID:6aa9c21565abe8002a798d32@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have questions about your tablet\, phone\, laptop\, email or a
 n app? Need help with eBooks or other online library services?\nWe know ke
 eping up with new technology can be difficult. Our staff are here to teach
  you technology tools and concepts in a friendly and casual setting. Pleas
 e bring your personal device and any questions you may have.\nDrop-in help
  available on a first come\, first serve basis. Space may be limited depen
 ding on attendance.\nLonger questions may be referred to a 1-hour Book a L
 ibrarian appointment at a later date.\nNo technology repairs will be avail
 able at this event.
LOCATION:Brentwood\, Learning Centre\, 2nd Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9c21565abe8002a798d32
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
