UID:6ab58b0d08693b0f7374692c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us with your friends each month\, to enjoy a film.  Octo
 ber we'll be showing Practical Magic.  Get your Hallowe'en spirit on with
  this fun film which tells the story of two witch sisters\, Sally and Gill
 ian Owens\, who must break a 300-year-old family curse that dooms any man 
 they fall in love with to an early death.\nStarring:  Sandra Bullock\, Ni
 cole Kidman\, Aiden Quinn\, Diane Wiest and Stockard Channing\, just to na
 me a few.
LOCATION:Elmbrook Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab58b0d08693b0f7374692c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
