UID:6a8c7bd136204e08fbb6c7de@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a friendly group discussion about\nFamous Last Wor
 ds\nby Gillian McAllister.\nThis title is available from the Toronto Publi
 c Library in standard print\, large print\, audiobook\, and through TPL's
  OverDrive eBook and eAudiobook collection.
LOCATION:Brentwood\, 1st floor\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a8c7bd136204e08fbb6c7de
