DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T110000
UID:6aa1c75ea5dbde002aa317c2@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Find joy in using a simple pencil and piece of paper to create
  a beautiful piece of art. Bring your tea or coffee\, relax and socialize 
 during a laid-back session of drawing for everyone from beginners to more 
 advanced artists.\nDebora Dunn will share simple techniques and demonstrat
 e examples of symmetry\, texture\, line and form that artists of all level
 s will be able to follow to create intricate designs.
LOCATION:Leaside
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa1c75ea5dbde002aa317c2
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
