BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Shea Butter: Natural Skin Care & Everyday Wellness
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261010T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261010T120000
UID:6aac8283f5c6780c70491203@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:​This educational wellness workshop explores the benefits of
  shea butter and natural ingredients for skin hydration and everyday self-
 care. Participants will learn how traditional ingredients support healthy 
 skin and simple wellness routines. The program includes a short presentati
 on and demonstration of how natural body care formulas are created.\nDiscl
 osure: This program uses non-consumable scented products that can be appli
 ed to the skin.
LOCATION:Steeles
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aac8283f5c6780c70491203
