DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260926T150000
UID:6a9989c54cb69d003e2578ac@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:From allowances and budgeting to credit cards\, cell phones\, 
 and online spending\, today's children face financial decisions earlier th
 an ever. Join Dolly Cedeno\, CPA\, for an informative workshop that explor
 es practical ways to teach healthy money habits at every stage of childhoo
 d.\nLearn how to talk to your children about money\, encourage financial r
 esponsibility\, and help them develop the skills they need for lifelong fi
 nancial success.\nDolly Cedeno\, CPA\, is a Senior Compliance Consultant a
 t Wells Fargo Bank with more than 25 years of experience in audit and comp
 liance.
LOCATION:Richview\, Program Room A\, 2nd Floor
