BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Investing Basics
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261013T150000
UID:6ab40710607483003829037a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:New to investing? Learn the basics of this important part of f
 inancial literacy\, including how to save with the goal of investing\, typ
 es of investments\, how to open an account\, types of accounts\, how to av
 oid financial frauds and scams\, and more.\nDrop-in\, no registration requ
 ired.
LOCATION:Wychwood\, Program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab40710607483003829037a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:DJ At Any Age: Memories in the Mix
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T200000
UID:6aa0608c2f780f1bf01c7983@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Bring out your inner DJ in this intergenerational program for 
 seniors and adults. Learn basic djing skills and connect with others over 
 a shared love of music. Artist and educator Deejay Vee from At Any Age wil
 l teach you how to use a dj controller and software in a fun and relaxed a
 tmosphere. Working individually or in pairs\, you'll create and exchange p
 laylists of songs that represent meaningful moments in your life.\nNo prio
 r experience needed.\nThis 5-week program series takes place every Thursda
 y from October 8th – November 5th.\nWeeks 1 – 4: Learn DJing skills.\n
 Week 5: Showcase! Perform your new skills for the group and your friends a
 nd family. Refreshments will be provided. Ingredient list will be availa
 ble at the program.\nInformation Collection Notice\n: The personal informa
 tion on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pub
 lic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information wi
 ll only be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluati
 on. Questions about how the library handles your information can be direct
 ed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge 
 Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, 1st Floor\, Children's Programming Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa0608c2f780f1bf01c7983
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
