DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261028T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261028T200000
UID:6a9b4e391c197d11325d6f21@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:What if your to-do list could check in on you\, notice what's 
 been stuck for weeks\, and offer to help instead of just sitting there?\nI
 n this class\, you'll explore a personal productivity system built around 
 an AI agent and a weekly-review practice. See how the agent loads goals\, 
 counts what actually got done\, flags the items that keep slipping\, and d
 rafts next week's plan. It can support without cheerleading\, asking "Why 
 has this been stuck for three weeks? Here are your options." You'll try it
  yourself with a practice set of goals\, and leave with the plain-text tem
 plates and a clearer map of how an AI might support you\, ready to build y
 our own system at home.\nPrerequisites: Mouse\, keyboarding and internet 
 skills. Computers are provided. No coding experience required.\nRegistra
 tion is required and will start September 9\, 2026 at 9:00 AM.\nNote: Your
