SUMMARY:The Career Confidence & Wellness Series: Rebounding from Rejection
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T180000
UID:6ab6cb6686d845003118c20c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Has a job rejection\, unanswered application\, or difficult in
 terview affected your confidence? We’ll explore the emotional and cognit
 ive impact of career setbacks and how to respond without letting rejection
  disarm your confidence or your next steps. You’ll learn how to identify
  what is within your control\, and reframe rejection as an opportunity to 
 learn and explore new possibilities. Through interactive activities and re
 flection\, you’ll develop strategies for self-care\, confidence\, and re
 silience.\nThis program is part of TPL's Career Coaches in Residence and i
 s generously supported by our lead donor Azrieli Foundation along with sup
 porting donors Fidelity Canada\, Friends of Toronto Public Library\, South
  Chapter and\nWilliam and Nona Heaslip Foundation.\nFor more information\,
  please visit\ntpl.ca/careercoach
