 ty of trees. Join the\nCity of Toronto Urban Forestry\nstaff to explore th
 e natural world on a local neighbourhood tour. Learn how to recognize dif
 ferent species and fun facts about their cultural and ecological importanc
 e.\nThe tour will start and end at the Downsview branch and will be guide
