 ved surfaces along the route. Please dress and prepare accordingly for thi
 s outdoor program (e.g. gloves/mittens\, hats\, sunscreen\, water\, comfor
 table shoes). This program takes place rain or shine. In the event of seve
 re inclement weather\, registrants will be notified of an alternative date
 . Children under 12 must be accompanied by a parent/caregiver.\nThis prog
 ram is part of TPL's\nOur Fragile Planet\nprogram series\, supported by Fr
 iends of Toronto Public Library\, South Chapter.​
