DESCRIPTION:It is very likely that someone will encounter their first inte
 rview experience in their youth\, yet the skills required to complete a su
 ccessful interview are often unpracticed and unknown to them. This program
  will introduce skills such as speaking professionally\, what kind of ques
 tions to expect\, interview processes\, preparation and learning to exude 
 genuine confidence.  Increase your potential for success by learning these
  integral skills to acing an interview!\nFor Younger Adults ages 18-24.
