 remaining seats will be filled on a first come\, first serve basis until c
 apacity is reached. If you wish to save your work from this hands-on prog
 ram\, please bring your own USB stick.\nAbout the AI Tools Used in This Pr
 ogram\nThis program includes activities that use agentic AI tools (listed 
 below) on library laptops.\nYou do not need to create your own account for
  this program.\nParticipants are encouraged to follow the Resident’s gui
 dance throughout sessions\, which include best practices on using AI.\nWe 
 encourage you to review the privacy statements of each tool prior to atten
 ding this program:\nClaude Code\nLearn more about the tool\nReview privacy
  policy\nClaude Cowork\nLearn more about the tool\nReview privacy policy\n
 Google Anti-Gravity\nLearn more about the tool\nReview privacy policy\nGoo
