UID:6a9c612c2dac6e003724602e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Pick and choose your own dried florals from a floral bar and m
 ake your own mini dried bouquet. With gentle guidance from an expert flora
 l designer\, you’ll create your own dried arrangement to take home!\nThi
 s program is intended for young adults only. Registration is required\, if
  the participant is not present within the first 10 minutes of the program
 \, spots will be made available to the public.
LOCATION:Woodside Square
