SUMMARY:Financial Literacy and Tax Management for Newcomer Entrepreneurs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261007T150000
UID:6a9c556a6562d0229684ec79@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Newcomer entrepreneurs will learn about the essential financia
 l tools to succeed in Canada as a self-employed professional. This worksho
 p is designed to build your confidence as a sole proprietor. Learn how to 
 register your business number and GST/HST number and learn how to file you
 r taxes. The presenter will also discuss effective strategies for managing
  your business finances and how to divide your income to save for taxes.\n
 Limited spots. Registration required.\nThis program is part of Small Busin
 ess Month.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, First Floor Program Room (CPR)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a9c556a6562d0229684ec79
