  Fitness expands traditional ideas of what democracy is by exploring the s
 kills that help people participate in civic life\, build understanding and
  work together.\nIn this session\, we’ll exercise our\nActive Listening\
 nmuscles. In a democracy\, everyone has the right to speak. Being heard re
 quires that someone listens. When you listen openly and with curiosity\, y
 ou create understanding and trust.\nThis program is for\nadults\,\nplease 
