DESCRIPTION:New to investing? Learn the basics of this important part of f
 inancial literacy\, including how to save with the goal of investing\, typ
 es of investments\, how to open an account\, types of accounts\, how to av
 oid financial frauds and scams\, and more.\nPresented by\nCanadian Investm
 ent Regulatory Organization (CIRO)\n\, a national self-regulatory organiza
 tion that oversees all investment dealers\, mutual fund dealers and tradin
 g activity on Canada’s debt and equity marketplaces.\nToronto Public Lib
 rary is committed to accessibility. Please call or email us if you are Dea
