DESCRIPTION:Wellness Recovery Action Plan (WRAP) is for\nanyone\nlooking 
 to strengthen their well-being—whether you’re supporting your mental h
 ealth\, managing stress\, or simply wanting to feel more balanced and resi
 lient in daily life. This session is an overview of WRAP\, and will equip 
 participants with the information they need to decide if a longer WRAP ser
 ies is the right fit for them.\nThis program will be delivered by\nHope + 
 Me\n.\nRegistration:\nThis virtual event is free to join and will take pla
 ce on\nZoom\n.\nRegister to receive an email with details on how to join t
 he session approximately 24 hrs before the event and to get a link to the 
 recording.\nCaptions will be available.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-\nJoining 
 and participating in a Zoom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\nInformatio
 n Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected b
